#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:5
#: 8b606e89c24a422ab611c36b4c88689a
msgid "SkyRocket Software"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:7
#: cfe63b0d24bb4d23947cc4528546fe1f
msgid "the drone shipped with a custom version of ArduPilot (Copter) which is close to Copter-3.5 but now additional features (notch filter, etc).  `GitHub repo is here <https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/ardupilot>`__ in the skyviper-stable branch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:8
#: bd72266e3c65410bb4f4385243907fc1
msgid "firmware source for the video board is `here <https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/Sonix>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:9
#: 237df14efe9f49438a7b2081d1ffd99e
msgid "`APWeb <https://github.com/ArduPilot/APWeb>`__ (a tiny open source web server) runs on the drone and allows easy calibration, modification of parameters, uploading firmware to both the drone and transmitter, downloading log files, pictures and videos."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:10
#: 67786d15db2246b1bd5926f18a1e1de3
msgid "the transmitter has a relatively low powered STM8 processor running open source software written by Tridge (incorporates some code from Paparazzi).  `Github repo is here <https://github.com/SkyRocketToys/STM8TX>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:11
#: fc052f7a57944f9a8013206f09b72543
msgid "live video can be viewed through a SkyRocket app or Mission Planner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:14
#: 96df299050bf4aceab4fb78e50c14d6c
msgid "Uploading alternative firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:19
#: 832b0d8ac69c405aa241f12923238143
msgid "The instructions below describe how to uploading alternative firmware to the drone.  Normally we recommend users stick with the official firmware from SkyRocket but for those interested in trying the very latest features from ArduPilot, participating in beta testing or for those who wish to create their own custom firmware, these instructions are useful."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:21
#: 2fcb06243b934b848e2d35b5299d5d31
msgid "Note that alternative firmwares are use **at your own risk** and probably void your warranty."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:23
#: 02c37dc28d9c45ce97e794203705d15e
msgid "**Which firmware to use?**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:25
#: 159da1964d594cb0b91208c669d44393
msgid "As of early 2018 there are two versions of the firmware available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:27
#: fc76d642c2674c8386f2d587501ef155
msgid "the `official firmware from skyrocket <http://firmware.sky-viper.com/latest/>`__ (see file ending with \".abin\") is the safest firmware to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:28
#: 2ef4d524ae48444da8d46aa99ec85ead
msgid "the `latest firmware from ArduPilot <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/skyviper-v2450/>`__ includes some new features (i.e. :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`) but is also missing some features (i.e. ability to control vehicle during RTL)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:30
#: 6f1aad68a4dc4785b472b724fbee76f5
msgid "**Uploading using the SD card**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:32
#: a2b7e1baad61442ba0f863a617f8ecb5
msgid "powerdown the drone and remove the SD card from the back of the skyviper and insert into your PC (an SD card adapter may be required)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:33
#: 9ac410c65f58489a8b74cdbd9e67096c
msgid "copy the firmware into the top directory of the SD card and then rename it to \"flight_fw.abin\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:38
#: eca1b54418ed4db5bb8b09412bad80eb
msgid "place the sd card back into the drone and power up the vehicle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:39
#: 0338defdbb9f488894de0a9fa58de7bf
msgid "after about a minute the LEDs should flash and the vehicle should reconnect to the transmitter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:41
#: 4022a35a328641a1b8727dc805e32816
msgid "**Uploading using APWeb**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:43
#: 443357b26b8c492290b53367bd643ccf
msgid "from your PC, connect to the SkyViper wifi access point (normally called \"SKYVIPERGPS-xxxxxx\", password is \"vipergps\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:44
#: cbd8c4b5754e4ee9bac062222f8740f3
msgid "open a web browser to ``http://192.168.99.1`` and click the **Upgrade Firmware** link"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:49
#: e34d46e30ebc45e4bd16fea5213862aa
msgid "in the \"Upgrade ArduPilot Firmware\" section, push the \"Browse\" button and select the \\*.abin file downloaded above"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:50
#: 95d15a6bed1c4fbd901127a732e4873a
msgid "push the \"Upload File\" button and wait a minute or two.  The green bar at the top of the web page should crawl from left to right and then the autopilot should reboot and reconnect to the transmitter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:57
#: 5fd73487266e4493b7ff73456c8d349b
msgid "After a firmware upgrade it may be necessary to perform an accelerometer calibration.  This can be done from the web interface's \"Calibration\" page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:59
#: a326e47979144a548ab4bb69241d94df
msgid "**When things go wrong**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:61
#: 465943e9395c470d98c552ab954e36e7
msgid "If the drone becomes unresponsive or will not connect to the transmitter or the wifi access point does not appear, don't worry, it is nearly impossible to \"brick\" the skyviper.  Try these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:63
#: 8bccfda0b9be4a679785b8d302991fe0
msgid "download the official skyrocket firmware from `here <http://firmware.sky-viper.com/latest/>`__ (look for the file ending with \".abin\")."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:64
#: 0a65230a457e4066b6e1960d139f8995
msgid "use the \"Uploading using the SD card\" method above to upload the firmware to the drone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-software.rst:65
#: 9ac384be0afa4004a7cd3505b7147f98
msgid "if this does not work, try asking for help in the `SkyViper section of the ArduPilot forum <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter/skyviper>`__"
msgstr ""
